1
00:00:00,372 --> 00:00:01,791
Seekor burung kecil

2
00:00:01,811 --> 00:00:03,386
mencelupkan paruhnya ke laut.

3
00:00:03,406 --> 00:00:05,461
Sebanyak itulah ilmu manusia,

4
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:06,702
dibanding ilmu Allah.

5
00:00:06,722 --> 00:00:08,296
Dalam hadis riwayat Bukhari,

6
00:00:08,316 --> 00:00:09,999
Nabi Musa pernah ditanya siapa

7
00:00:10,019 --> 00:00:11,238
manusia paling berilmu.

8
00:00:11,258 --> 00:00:11,857
Ia menjawab:

9
00:00:11,877 --> 00:00:12,794
aku.

10
00:00:12,814 --> 00:00:14,281
Allah menegurnya,

11
00:00:14,301 --> 00:00:15,488
dan menunjukkan seorang hamba

12
00:00:15,508 --> 00:00:16,782
di pertemuan dua laut.

13
00:00:16,802 --> 00:00:18,486
Hadis itu menyebutnya Khidir.

14
00:00:18,506 --> 00:00:19,647
Musa berangkat bersama

15
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:21,179
pembantunya, membawa ikan

16
00:00:21,199 --> 00:00:22,364
sebagai bekal.

17
00:00:22,384 --> 00:00:23,417
Di sebuah batu,

18
00:00:23,437 --> 00:00:24,919
ikan itu melompat ke laut,

19
00:00:24,939 --> 00:00:26,260
dan di situlah tempatnya.

20
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,532
Musa minta ikut.

21
00:00:27,552 --> 00:00:28,135
Jawabnya:

22
00:00:28,155 --> 00:00:29,482
kamu tidak akan sanggup sabar

23
00:00:29,502 --> 00:00:30,140
bersamaku.

24
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,936
Pertama, mereka naik perahu,

25
00:00:31,956 --> 00:00:33,330
dan perahu itu dilubangi.

26
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,331
Musa protes.

27
00:00:34,351 --> 00:00:35,817
Kedua, mereka bertemu seorang

28
00:00:35,837 --> 00:00:36,671
anak muda,

29
00:00:36,691 --> 00:00:37,912
dan Khidir membunuhnya.

30
00:00:37,932 --> 00:00:39,420
Musa protes lebih keras.

31
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,030
Ketiga, di negeri yang menolak

32
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,020
menjamu mereka,

33
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,606
Khidir justru menegakkan

34
00:00:43,626 --> 00:00:44,829
dinding yang hampir roboh,

35
00:00:44,849 --> 00:00:45,784
tanpa upah.

36
00:00:45,804 --> 00:00:47,069
Musa bertanya lagi,

37
00:00:47,089 --> 00:00:48,029
dan di situlah mereka

38
00:00:48,049 --> 00:00:48,731
berpisah.

39
00:00:48,751 --> 00:00:50,356
Lalu semuanya dijelaskan.

40
00:00:50,376 --> 00:00:52,883
Perahu itu milik orang miskin;

41
00:00:52,903 --> 00:00:54,539
di depan ada raja yang

42
00:00:54,559 --> 00:00:55,700
merampas setiap perahu yang

43
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,368
baik.

44
00:00:56,388 --> 00:00:57,838
Anak muda itu dikhawatirkan

45
00:00:57,858 --> 00:00:58,829
menyeret orang tuanya yang

46
00:00:58,849 --> 00:01:00,323
beriman pada kekafiran.

47
00:01:00,343 --> 00:01:01,964
Dan di bawah dinding itu,

48
00:01:01,984 --> 00:01:03,171
tersimpan harta dua anak

49
00:01:03,191 --> 00:01:03,700
yatim.

50
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:04,928
Penutupnya:

51
00:01:04,948 --> 00:01:07,327
apa yang kuperbuat bukan

52
00:01:07,347 --> 00:01:08,778
menurut kemauanku sendiri.

53
00:01:08,798 --> 00:01:10,667
Itu surah Al-Kahfi ayat

54
00:01:10,687 --> 00:01:11,554
delapan puluh dua.

55
00:01:11,574 --> 00:01:12,838
Yang terlihat merugikan hari

56
00:01:12,858 --> 00:01:14,077
ini bisa jadi penyelamat yang

57
00:01:14,097 --> 00:01:15,179
belum kita pahami.

58
00:01:15,199 --> 00:01:16,433
Pernahkah kamu mengalami hal

59
00:01:16,453 --> 00:01:17,579
buruk yang belakangan ternyata

60
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:18,231
baik?

